The Industrial Tribunal (Central Procedure) Rules, 1954
- In these rules-
(a)
"the Act "means the Industrial Disputes Act, 1947 (
14 of 1947
);
(b)
"Chairman "means the Chairman of the Tribunal;
(c)
"member "means a member of the Tribunal;
(d)
"section "means a section of the Act;
(e)
"Tribunal "means the Industrial Tribunal constituted under section 7consisting of two or more members.
